{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 31,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        42.10532760620117,
        102.9627914428711,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "Close contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        54.273040771484375,
        407.9725341796875,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "A person who is not in the household but shared an enclosed space, such as a social gathering",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.79880142211914,
        66.27005004882812,
        407.94586181640625,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "place, workplace or facility, for extended periods during the day with the index case during",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.77180099487305,
        78.26705932617188,
        326.5498046875,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "the 3 months before commencement of the current treatment episode.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.78080368041992,
        96.26705932617188,
        80.1748046875,
        105.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        108.27603149414062,
        408.10791015625,
        117.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Out-of-household exposure is as likely to result in transmission as household exposure in many",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.93380355834961,
        120.27304077148438,
        408.17974853515625,
        129.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "situations. Molecular epidemiological studies showed that transmission was likely to occur",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01480484008789,
        132.27005004882812,
        408.5577697753906,
        141.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "in social settings such as informal bars in Mexico and South Africa and in facilities such as",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.38380813598633,
        144.26705932617188,
        408.5572509765625,
        153.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "correctional institutions and hospitals (14,15). Such sites (particularly social settings) are",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.3928108215332,
        156.26406860351562,
        408.1595458984375,
        165.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "difﬁcult to identify and require knowledge of the culture and of behavioral patterns in order",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.99459457397461,
        168.27304077148438,
        171.819580078125,
        177.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "to focus contact investigations.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.003597259521484,
        204.1023406982422,
        134.65858459472656,
        213.1023406982422
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01259994506836,
        216.27005004882812,
        410.17523193359375,
        225.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "A systematic process intended to identify previously undiagnosed cases of TB among",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04860305786133,
        228.26705932617188,
        410.2023010253906,
        237.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "the contacts of an index case. In some settings, the goal also includes testing for LTBI to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07560348510742,
        240.26406860351562,
        408.2763671875,
        249.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "identify possible candidates for preventive treatment. Contact investigation consists of two",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.11160659790039,
        252.26107788085938,
        317.1072692871094,
        261.2790832519531
      ],
      "text": "components: identiﬁcation and prioritization, and clinical evaluation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03139877319336,
        270.27593994140625,
        80.42539978027344,
        279.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        282.27606201171875,
        410.1865234375,
        291.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "The rationale for contact investigation is that people who were recently infected with",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0598030090332,
        294.2730712890625,
        408.2248229980469,
        303.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis are at increased risk for the development of active TB within 1–2 years after",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0598030090332,
        306.27008056640625,
        408.1976318359375,
        315.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "acquisition of the infection. It is assumed that people exposed to a person with infectious TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        318.26708984375,
        408.170654296875,
        327.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "might recently have been infected and are thus at increased risk for currently having TB or for",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.005802154541016,
        330.26409912109375,
        230.81411743164062,
        339.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "development of the disease in the near future.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03010177612305,
        366.105224609375,
        205.80308532714844,
        375.105224609375
      ],
      "text": "Contact identiﬁcation and prioritization",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03910446166992,
        378.27294921875,
        410.14801025390625,
        387.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "A systematic process to identify contacts with or at increased risk for development of TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0211067199707,
        390.26995849609375,
        408.2215881347656,
        399.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "For the purposes of these recommendations, the deﬁnition of contact identiﬁcation and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05710983276367,
        402.2669677734375,
        408.23968505859375,
        411.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "prioritization includes an interview with the index case to obtain the names and ages of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07510757446289,
        414.26397705078125,
        408.1941833496094,
        423.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "contacts and an assessment of contacts’ risk for having (generally based on the presence of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02920150756836,
        426.27294921875,
        408.19384765625,
        435.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "symptoms compatible with TB) or developing TB, to determine those for whom clinical",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02920150756836,
        438.26995849609375,
        204.5332489013672,
        447.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "evaluation (deﬁned below) is indicated.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.038204193115234,
        456.26995849609375,
        80.43220520019531,
        465.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "Remark",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        468.2760314941406,
        408.20648193359375,
        477.2760314941406
      ],
      "text": "At a minimum, all index cases should be assessed with the above criteria to determine",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04179763793945,
        480.2730407714844,
        407.9908447265625,
        489.2730407714844
      ],
      "text": "whether contact investigation should be undertaken. For example, contact investigation would",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.8257942199707,
        492.2700500488281,
        409.9255676269531,
        501.2700500488281
      ],
      "text": "not usually be conducted for an index case with only extrapulmonary TB, except children",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.79879379272461,
        502.147705078125,
        407.9546203613281,
        513.2670288085938
      ],
      "text": "<  5 years of age, in whom investigations would be undertaken in an attempt to identify the",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.789798736572266,
        516.2640380859375,
        97.2747802734375,
        525.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "source case.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        225.62020874023438,
        651.97265625,
        233.5926971435547,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "29",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}